{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49372","headline":"纱窗恨 一 · 毛文锡","name":"纱窗恨 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新春燕子还来至，一双飞。\n垒巢泥湿时时坠，涴人衣。\n後园里看百花发，香风拂，绣户金扉。\n月照纱窗，恨依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}